  "description": "ITC Mail Activities\n\n✅ No Microsoft Outlook installation required — works on any robot machine without Office, COM, or MAPI dependencies.\n\nExchange Activities:\n- Exchange Connect — authenticate to Exchange and return an active session\n- Exchange Disconnect — safely clear credentials and release the session\n- Exchange Reply Email — reply to an email by Message-ID with optional recipients and attachments\n- Exchange Forward Email — forward an email to recipients with optional body and attachments\n\nOutlook File Activities:\n- MSG to EML Converter — convert .msg files to .eml format directly without Outlook\n- Read Mail From File — read .msg or .eml files and return a MailMessage object without Outlook\n\nExtraction Activities:\n- Extract Tables from Mail Body — extract HTML tables from email body as DataTable array\n\nBuilt for .NET Framework 4.6.1 and UiPath Studio Windows legacy compatibility.",
  "iconFile": "UiPathLogo.png",
